\\u00fac <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\" data-start=\\\"2312\\\" data-end=\\\"2334\\\">Tour H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i 1 ng\\u00e0y<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"}]', '/userfiles/images/tours/hanoi/train-street-coffee.webp', '[\"\\/userfiles\\/images\\/tours\\/hanoi\\/Hanoi-Train-Street-Coffee-04.jpg\",\"\\/userfiles\\/images\\/tours\\/hanoi\\/train-street-coffee.webp\",\"\\/userfiles\\/images\\/tours\\/hanoi\\/train-street.webp\"]', 'tour-du-lich-ha-noi-1-ngay-hanoi002', '<h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2361\">Giá Tour Bao Gồm</h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2403\">– Xe <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2387\">Limousine 17 chỗ</strong> theo lịch trình<br>– 02 chai nước suối/người/ngày<br><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2464\">– Bữa trưa đặc sản Hà Nội</strong> (Bún chả, Bánh mì)<br>– Hướng dẫn viên song ngữ Việt – Anh chuyên nghiệp<br>– Vé thắng cảnh các điểm tham quan trong chương trình<br><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2560\">– Trà chiều + kẹo lạc</strong> tại làng gốm Bát Tràng</p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2606\">Không Bao Gồm</h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2635\">– Đồ uống ngoài chương trình<br>– Thuế GTGT, bảo hiểm du lịch<br>– Tiền tip cho hướng dẫn viên, lái xe</p>', NULL, '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacin