\u00e0ng An\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;\\\">12h00|<\\/strong><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;\\\">&nbsp;Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u1ec1 nh\\u00e0 h\\u00e0ng ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a, c\\u00f9ng th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c s\\u1ea3n n\\u01a1i \\u0111\\u00e2y (C\\u01a1m ch\\u00e1y, d\\u00ea n\\u00fai\\u2026)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">13h30|<\\/strong>&nbsp;Sau b\\u1eefa tr\\u01b0a, xe v\\u00e0 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn \\u0111\\u01b0a du kh\\u00e1ch ra b\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u00f2 Tr\\u00e0ng An&nbsp;l\\u00ean thuy\\u1ec1n \\u0111i d\\u1ecdc theo su\\u1ed1i gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1nh \\u0111\\u1ed3ng l\\u00faa th\\u0103m&nbsp;<\\/span><em style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">khu du l\\u1ecbch Tr\\u00e0ng An&nbsp;M\\u1edbi<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng d\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u00e1 v\\u00f4i, thung l\\u0169ng v\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng s\\u00f4ng ng\\u00f2i \\u0111an xen t\\u1ea1o n\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t kh\\u00f4ng gian huy\\u1ec1n \\u1ea3o, k\\u1ef3 b\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/span><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><a style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(16, 90, 142);margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/di-san-trang-an-e1747110938916.jpg\\\"><strong><img class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:1010px;word-spacing:0px;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/di-san-trang-an-e1747110938916.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Di s\\u1ea3n Tr\\u00e0ng An\\\" id=\\\"attachment_24884\\\"><\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:1010px;word-spacing:0px;\\\" id=\\\"attachment_24884\\\"><p class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0px 15px;padding:0px;\\\" id=\\\"caption-attachment-24884\\\">Di s\\u1ea3n Tr\\u00e0ng An<\\/p><\\/div><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">V\\u1edbi tuy\\u1ebfn n\\u00e0y qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch c\\u00f3 c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i tham quan <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">4 hang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng<\\/strong> t\\u1ef1 nhi\\u00ean trong s\\u1ed1 nh\\u1eefng hang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1eb9p nh\\u1ea5t trong khu <\\/span><\\/span><a style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(16, 90, 142);margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/du-lich-ninh-binh\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>du l\\u1ecbch Ninh Binh<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> l\\u00e0 Tr\\u00e0ng An, Hang L\\u1ea5m, Hang V\\u1ea1ng, Hang Th\\u00e1nh Tr\\u01b0\\u1ee3t v\\u00e0 hang cu\\u1ed1i c\\u00f9ng l\\u00e0 Hang \\u0110\\u1ea1i. Tuy\\u1ebfn n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd r\\u1ea5t ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng b\\u1ea1n tr\\u1ebb, nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi th\\u00edch ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea3nh Check in, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7 v\\u1ec1 h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ng\\u1ed3i \\u0111\\u00f2 th\\u0103m hang c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u01b0u l\\u1ea1i nh\\u1eefng c\\u1ea3m x\\u00fac, nh\\u1eefng b\\u1ee9c h\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1eb9p trong h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh v\\u1ec1 th\\u0103m <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Tr\\u00e0ng An \\u2013 Di s\\u1ea3n v\\u0103n h\\u00f2a v\\u00e0 thi\\u00ean nhi\\u00ean th\\u1ebf gi\\u1edbi!<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">17h00 |<\\/strong>&nbsp;Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch l\\u00ean xe tr\\u1edf v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">19h30 |<\\/strong>&nbsp;Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i. K\\u1ebft th\\u00fac ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Tour Tr\\u00e0ng An \\u2013 B\\u00e1i \\u0110\\u00ednh 1 ng\\u00e0y<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">H\\u1eb9n g\\u1eb7p l\\u1ea1i qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch!<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '/userfiles/images/tours/ninhbinh/tour-bai-dinh-trang-an-3-ngay-2-dem-1.jpg', NULL, 'tour-trang-an-bai-dinh-1-ngay', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;\">⮚GIÁ BAO GỒM:</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">–</span><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"> Xe ô tô du lịch đưa đón theo chương trình</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Ăn trưa buffet theo chương trình</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Vé thuyền thăm quan tại Tràng An 250.000đ/ vé</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Vé xe điện khứ hồi tại Bái Đính 100.000đ/ người/ 2 chiều</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Hướng dẫn viên phục vụ nhiệt tình, thành thạo, chu đáo xuyên suốt tuyến du lịch</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Nước uống phục vụ trên xe, 01 chai/người/ngày</span></i></em></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">⮚KHÔNG BAO GỒM:</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– </span><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Hóa đơn thuế GTGT</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Đồ uống trong các bữa ăn, các chi phí cá nhân khác</span></i></em></span></p>', NULL, '<h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1963\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1961\">Lý do nên chọn Tour Tràng An – Bái Đính 1 ngày</strong></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2017\">Trải nghiệm 2 điểm đến nổi bật nhất Ninh Bình</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\">Kết hợp <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2053\">du lịch tâm linh</strong> tại chùa Bái Đính và <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2096\">du lịch sinh thái</strong> tại Tràng An trong cùng một ngày.</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2172\">Dịch vụ chuyên nghiệp, tiện lợi</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\">Xe đưa đón đời mới, hướng dẫn viên tận tình, lịch trình hợp lý giúp bạn có một chuyến đi trọn vẹn.</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2324\">Khám phá cảnh đẹp thiên nhiên kỳ vĩ</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\">Hệ thống hang động tuyệt đẹp và khung cảnh non nước hữu tình của Tràng An.</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2446\">Tiết kiệm thời gian &amp; chi phí</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2581\">Chỉ với <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2472\">1 ngày</strong>, bạn có thể khám phá những danh thắng nổi bật của Ninh Bình mà không mất quá nhiều thời gian hay công sức.</li></ul>', '2025-09-09 02:14:38', '2025-09-09 02:14:38');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `tour_code`, `name`, `duration`, `departure_point`, `remaining_slots`, `price_adult`, `price_child`, `price_toddler`, `price_infant`, `transport_mode`, `short_description`, `tour_description`, `priority`, `tour_schedule`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `slug`, `services_note`, `note`, `characteristic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7, 'HOALU001', 'Tour Hoa Lư – Tam Cốc 1 ngày', '1 ngày', 'Hà Nội', 100, 700000, 700000, 700000, 700000, 'Ô tô', 'Tour Hoa Lư – Tam Cốc 1 ngày là lựa chọn lý tưởng cho những ai muốn khám phá vẻ đẹp thiên nhiên kỳ vĩ của Ninh Bình kết hợp với giá trị lịch sử văn hóa đặc sắc. Chỉ cách Hà Nội khoảng 100km, Hoa Lư – Tam Cốc mang đến một trải nghiệm trọn vẹn từ quá khứ hào hùng của kinh đô xưa đến phong cảnh hữu tình của “vịnh Hạ Long trên cạn.”\r\n\r\nHành trình này sẽ đưa bạn đến thăm Cố đô Hoa Lư – nơi lưu giữ dấu ấn triều đại Đinh – Lê, chèo thuyền khám phá Tam Cốc – vùng non nước hữu tình với những dãy núi đá vôi trùng điệp, và đạp xe tham quan những làng quê yên bình của Ninh Bình.', NULL, 6, '[{\"title\":\"S\\u00e1ng: Hoa L\\u01b0\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">07h30 \\u2013 8h00<\\/strong>: Xe v\\u00e0 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1i khu v\\u1ef1c ph\\u1ed1 C\\u1ed5 v\\u00e0 Nh\\u00e0 h\\u00e1t l\\u1edbn kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh \\u0111i Ninh B\\u00ecnh. Tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u0111i qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch d\\u1eebng ngh\\u1ec9 20 ph\\u00fat.<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">10h30<\\/strong>: <\\/span><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:24px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ebfn Ninh B\\u00ecnh, Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u00e0o th\\u0103m c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 Hoa L\\u01b0 (Kinh \\u0111\\u00f4&nbsp;c\\u1ee7a Vi\\u1ec7t Nam v\\u00e0o th\\u1ebf k\\u1ef7 10), t\\u00ecm hi\\u1ec3u v\\u1ec1 l\\u1ecbch s\\u1eed c\\u00e1c tri\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u1ea1i phong ki\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ecb v\\u00ec Vi\\u1ec7t Nam.<\\/span><\\/span><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><img class=\\\"image_resized wp-caption aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:block;font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:1010px;word-spacing:0px;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/09\\/Ninh-binh-day-tour-29-e1739860598375.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"C\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 Hoa L\\u01b0 Ninh B\\u00ecnh\\\" id=\\\"attachment_21484\\\"><\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-caption aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:block;font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:1010px;word-spacing:0px;\\\" id=\\\"attachment_21484\\\"><p class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0px 15px;padding:0px;\\\" id=\\\"caption-attachment-21484\\\">C\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 Hoa L\\u01b0 Ninh B\\u00ecnh<\\/p><\\/div><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:24px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ec1n th\\u1edd vua \\u0110inh Ti\\u00ean Ho\\u00e0ng<\\/strong><\\/span><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:24px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;to\\u1ea1 l\\u1ea1c t\\u1ea1i khu v\\u1ef1c trung t\\u00e2m C\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 Hoa L\\u01b0, c\\u00f3 l\\u1ed1i ki\\u1ebfn tr\\u00fac \\u201cn\\u1ed9i c\\u00f4ng ngo\\u1ea1i qu\\u1ed1c\\u201d&nbsp; l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng l\\u1ed1i ki\\u1ebfn tr\\u00fac n\\u1ed5i ti\\u1ebfng v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t c\\u1ee7a Vi\\u1ec7t Nam. V\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ec1n th\\u1edd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c to\\u1ea1 l\\u1ea1c \\u1edf ngay v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed ch\\u00ednh \\u0111i\\u1ec7n v\\u1edbi to\\u00e0 nh\\u00e0 ba gian: B\\u00e1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng, Thi\\u00eau h\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 Ch\\u00ednh cung. Tr\\u00ean s\\u00e2n r\\u1ed3ng ngay tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc gian gi\\u1eefa c\\u1ee7a B\\u00e1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u00e0 tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc nghi m\\u00f4n ngo\\u1ea1i c\\u00f3 s\\u1eadp long s\\u00e0ng b\\u1eb1ng \\u0111\\u00e1 xanh nguy\\u00ean kh\\u1ed1i \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00f4ng nh\\u1eadn l\\u00e0 b\\u1ea3o v\\u1eadt Qu\\u1ed1c gia.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ec1n th\\u1edd vua L\\u00ea \\u0110\\u1ea1i H\\u00e0nh<\\/strong>, l\\u00e0 to\\u00e0 c\\u0169ng bao g\\u1ed3m B\\u00e1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng, Thi\\u00eau h\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 Ch\\u00ednh cung. Tuy nhi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ec1n vua L\\u00ea \\u0110\\u1ea1i H\\u00e0nh c\\u00f3 quy m\\u00f4 nh\\u1ecf h\\u01a1n v\\u00e0 th\\u1ea5p h\\u01a1n so v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ec1n th\\u1edd vua \\u0110inh Ti\\u00ean Ho\\u00e0ng, kh\\u00f4ng gian trong \\u0111\\u1ec1n g\\u1ea7n g\\u0169i v\\u00e0 huy\\u1ec1n \\u1ea3o, v\\u1edbi l\\u1ed1i ki\\u1ebfn tr\\u00fac \\u0111\\u1ed9c \\u0111\\u1ea3o ngh\\u1ec7 thu\\u1eadt ch\\u1ea1m kh\\u1eafc v\\u00f4 c\\u00f9ng tinh x\\u1ea3o c\\u00f9ng v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea5t li\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u01a1n son th\\u00e9p v\\u00e0ng v\\u00f4 c\\u00f9ng n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi ho\\u1ea1 ti\\u1ebft mang \\u0111\\u1eadm ch\\u1ea5t cung \\u0111\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0 v\\u0103n ho\\u00e1 ngh\\u1ec7 thu\\u1eadt \\u0111\\u1eb7c s\\u1eafc.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Thung l\\u0169ng Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Y\\u00ean<\\/strong>&nbsp;sau khi r\\u1eddi \\u0111\\u00f4 v\\u1ec1 kinh th\\u00e0nh Th\\u0103ng Long th\\u00ec c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 Hoa L\\u01b0 \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ed5i t\\u00ean th\\u00e0nh Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Y\\u00ean, \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi v\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u1ea5t Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Y\\u00ean n\\u00e0y du kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ng\\u1eafm nh\\u00ecn v\\u1ebb \\u0111\\u1eb9p thanh b\\u00ecnh, y\\u00ean \\u1ea3 \\u0111\\u1eadm ch\\u1ea5t m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u1ea5t C\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 x\\u01b0a.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><a style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(16, 90, 142);margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration