order-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Hoạt động đi xe đạp ngắm cảnh</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Ăn trưa Buffet theo chương trình</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Hướng dẫn viên thành thạo nhiệt tình.</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– 1 chai nước suối / khách / ngày</span></i></em></span></div><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;\">⮚</strong><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">KHÔNG BAO GỒM:</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– </span><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Hóa đơn thuế VAT</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Đồ uống trong các bữa ăn.</span></i></em></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><i><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">– Tiền típ cho hướng dẫn và lái xe</span></i></em></span></p>', NULL, '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2180\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2178\">Lý do bạn nên chọn Tour Hoa Lư – Tràng An – Hang Múa 1 ngày</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2351\">💎 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2215\">Hành trình đầy đủ &amp; thú vị</strong>: Chỉ trong một ngày, bạn sẽ khám phá cả ba điểm đến nổi tiếng nhất trong tour <a style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(16, 90, 142);margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://thesinhtour.com/du-lich-ninh-binh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>du lịch Ninh Bình</strong></a>, từ di tích lịch sử đến cảnh quan thiên nhiên tuyệt đẹp.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2472\">🚗 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2380\">Di chuyển thuận tiện</strong>: Xe du lịch đời mới đưa đón tận nơi tại Hà Nội, giúp bạn tiết kiệm thời gian và công sức.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2606\">🏞 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2499\">Cảnh sắc tuyệt đẹp</strong>: Tràng An và Hang Múa là những địa điểm “sống ảo” bậc nhất với khung cảnh thiên nhiên hoang sơ, hùng vĩ.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2727\">🛶 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2641\">Trải nghiệm thuyền độc đáo</strong>: Du thuyền qua những hang động kỳ vĩ tại Tràng An, tận hưởng không gian thanh bình.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2808\">🍲 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2751\">Ẩm thực hấp dẫn</strong>: Thưởng thức đặc sản Ninh Bình với hương vị đặc trưng.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2927\">👨‍🏫 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2848\">Hướng dẫn viên chuyên nghiệp</strong>: Đội ngũ hướng dẫn viên tận tâm, am hiểu lịch sử giúp chuyến đi thêm thú vị.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3074\">📸 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2954\">Check-in đẹp mê ly</strong>: Hang Múa là điểm đến lý tưởng để săn những bức ảnh tuyệt đẹp nhìn xuống cánh đồng và dòng sông ngoằn ngoèo bên dưới.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3144\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3142\">Đặt Tour Hoa Lư – Tràng An – Hang Múa ngay hôm nay!</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">💛 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Hãy để chuyến đi này giúp bạn tìm về sự an yên và thanh tịnh trong tâm hồn!</strong> 🙏✨</p>', '2025-09-09 02:23:10', '2025-09-09 02:23:44');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `tour_code`, `name`, `duration`, `departure_point`, `remaining_slots`, `price_adult`, `price_child`, `price_toddler`, `price_infant`, `transport_mode`, `short_description`, `tour_description`, `priority`, `tour_schedule`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `slug`, `services_note`, `note`, `characteristic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(9, 'QUANGNINH001', 'Tour du lịch Quảng Ninh 1 ngày từ Hà Nội', '1 ngày', 'Hà Nội', 100, 750000, 750000, 750000, 750000, 'Ô tô', 'Quảng Ninh – vùng đất được thiên nhiên ưu ái với những kỳ quan thiên nhiên hùng vĩ và di sản thế giới Vịnh Hạ Long, là điểm đến lý tưởng cho chuyến du lịch ngắn ngày. Tour du lịch Quảng Ninh 1 ngày từ Hà Nội sẽ mang đến cho bạn những trải nghiệm tuyệt vời, khám phá vẻ đẹp của Vịnh Hạ Long, tận hưởng không gian biển cả và thưởng thức hải sản tươi ngon.\r\nVới lịch trình gọn gàng, di chuyển thuận tiện và dịch vụ chất lượng, tour du lịch Hạ Long phù hợp với những ai muốn tận hưởng một ngày thư giãn giữa thiên nhiên nhưng không có nhiều thời gian.', NULL, 8, '[{\"title\":\"S\\u00e1ng: Di chuy\\u1ec3n\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">8h15 \\u2013 9h00:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Xe v\\u00e0 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n trong khu v\\u1ef1c ph\\u1ed1 c\\u1ed5 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i ho\\u1eb7c t\\u1ea1i Nh\\u00e0 H\\u00e1t L\\u1edbn H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i. Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh \\u0111i H\\u1ea1 Long theo&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">\\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng cao t\\u1ed1c m\\u1edbi H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i \\u2013 H\\u1ea3i Ph\\u00f2ng \\u2013 H\\u1ea1 Long <\\/strong><\\/span><em style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">( N\\u1ebfu qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng xe \\u0111\\u01b0a \\u0111\\u00f3n c\\u1ee7a nh\\u00e0 t\\u00e0u )<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">12h00:<\\/strong> Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0111\\u1ebfn b\\u1ebfn t\\u00e0u H\\u1ea1 Long l\\u00e0m th\\u1ee7 t\\u1ee5c l\\u00ean t\\u00e0u.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Chi\\u1ec1u: H\\u1ea1 Long\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">12h30:<\\/strong> T\\u00e0u kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh r\\u1eddi b\\u1ebfn H\\u1ea1 Long v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0111i th\\u0103m c\\u1ea3nh quan tr\\u00ean V\\u1ecbnh. Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a tr\\u00ean t\\u00e0u. Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 v\\u1eeba th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c c\\u00e1c m\\u00f3n \\u0103n, v\\u1eeba ng\\u1eafm nh\\u00ecn c\\u1ea3nh V\\u1ecbnh hai b\\u00ean v\\u1edbi h\\u00e0ng ng\\u00e0n h\\u00f2n \\u0111\\u1ea3o l\\u1edbn nh\\u1ecf kh\\u00e1c nhau nh\\u01b0: <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">h\\u00f2n Ch\\u00f3 \\u0110\\u00e1, h\\u00f2n G\\u00e0 Ch\\u1ecdi, h\\u00f2n L\\u01b0 H\\u01b0\\u01a1ng\\u2026.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">14h00:<\\/strong> T\\u00e0u&nbsp;<\\/span><em style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">H\\u1ea1 Long 1 ng\\u00e0y<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp; s\\u1ebd d\\u1eebng t\\u1ea1i khu v\\u1ef1c&nbsp;<\\/span><em style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">B\\u1ed3 H\\u00f2n<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">. T\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd tham gia 3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh theo ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh:<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">\\u2013 H\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">The Sinh Tourist<\\/strong>&nbsp;s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0a c\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n th\\u0103m&nbsp;<\\/span><em style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">hang S\\u1eedng S\\u1ed1t<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"> \\u2013 ch\\u1ec9 v\\u00e0i b\\u01b0\\u1edbc ch\\u00e2n l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn c\\u1ee7a hang S\\u1eedng S\\u1ed1t, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 h\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1eb9p nh\\u1ea5t v\\u00e0 r\\u1ed9ng nh\\u1ea5t trong qu\\u1ea7n th\\u1ec3 hang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a H\\u1ea1 Long. Hang th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 \\u0111\\u1eb9p v\\u00e0 l\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m th\\u0103m quan kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ecf l\\u1ee1. Nh\\u1eefng du kh\\u00e1ch kh\\u00f4ng th\\u0103m hang S\\u1eedng S\\u1ed1t c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ng\\u1ed3i t\\u1ea1i t\\u00e0u nh\\u00e2m nhi \\u0111\\u1ed3 u\\u1ed1ng ng\\u1eafm c\\u1ea3nh V\\u1ecbnh ho\\u1eb7c \\u0111\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0i trang s\\u00e1ch m\\u00ecnh th\\u00edch.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p><img class=\\\"image_resized wp-caption aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:block;font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:1545px;word-spacing:0px;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/03\\/Dragon-King-28x28cm6-FILEminimizer.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Tour du l\\u1ecbch Qu\\u1ea3ng Ninh 1 ng\\u00e0y t\\u1eeb H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/03\\/Dragon-King-28x28cm6-FILEminimizer.jpg 1535w, https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/03\\/Dragon-King-28x28cm6-FILEminimizer-300x150.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/03\\/Dragon-King-28x28cm6-FILEminimizer-1024x512.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/thesinhtour.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2017\\/03\\/Dragon-King-28x28cm6-FILEminimizer-768x384.jpg 768w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" width=\\\"1535\\\" id=\\\"attachment_15866\\\"><\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-caption aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:block;font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding:5px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-t