\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">S\\u1eedng S\\u1ed1t<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;\\u2013 hang \\u0111\\u1eb9p &amp; r\\u1ed9ng nh\\u1ea5t trong qu\\u1ea7n th\\u1ec3 hang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a v\\u1ecbnh H\\u1ea1 Long<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Ti\\u1ebfp theo t\\u00e0u \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch ra&nbsp;khu v\\u1ef1c <\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>Hang Lu\\u1ed3n<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">, du kh\\u00e1ch c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3<\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;ch\\u00e8o kayak\\/ thuy\\u1ec1n nan<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;ho\\u1eb7c ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i t\\u1ea1i t\\u00e0u.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 15px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>15.00:&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Sau khi tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u0103m hang, ch\\u00e8o kayak,<\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;\\u0110\\u1ea3o Titov<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3&nbsp;<\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>b\\u01a1i l\\u1ed9i hay t\\u1eafm n\\u1eafng tr\\u00ean b\\u00e3i c\\u00e1t tr\\u1eafng m\\u1ecbn<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3&nbsp;<\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><i style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong>leo l\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ec9nh Titov<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">&nbsp;\\u0111\\u1ec3 ng\\u1eafm to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea3nh v\\u1ecbnh Halong v\\u1edbi h\\u00e0ng ng\\u00e0n m\\u1ecfm n\\u00fai \\u0111\\u00e3 v\\u00f4i nh\\u00f4 l\\u00ean t\\u1eeb m\\u1eb7t n\\u01b0\\u1edbc xanh bi\\u1ebfc .<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">16h30:<\\/strong> T\\u00e0u \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch quay tr\\u1edf l\\u1ea1i b\\u1ebfn t\\u00e0u, tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u1ec1 qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c ti\\u1ec7c tr\\u00e0 v\\u00e0 b\\u00e1nh truy\\u1ec1n th\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ee7a Vi\\u1ec7t Nam.<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">18h00:<\\/strong> Xe \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch quay tr\\u1edf v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">20h30-21h00<\\/strong>: Xe tr\\u1edf v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u0169 \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch, chia tay \\u0111o\\u00e0n k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh va h\\u1eb9n g\\u1eb7p l\\u1ea1i qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh sau.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p><img class=\\\"wp-caption aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:block;font-family:Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;orphans:2;padding: