lor:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Du kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ef1 do t\\u1eafm bi\\u1ec3n \\u0110\\u1ed3 S\\u01a1n<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">18h00:<\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch c\\u00f3 m\\u1eb7t t\\u1ea1i nh\\u00e0 h\\u00e0ng c\\u1ee7a kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ec3 tham gia ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh \\\"GALA DINNER\\\" s\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c r\\u1ea5t chu \\u0111\\u00e1o v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 chu\\u1ea9n b\\u1ecb c\\u00f4ng phu c\\u1ee7a \\u0111\\u1ed9i ng\\u0169 nh\\u00e2n vi\\u00ean chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p. Ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa giao l\\u01b0u v\\u0103n ngh\\u1ec7, c\\u00e1c tr\\u00f2 ch\\u01a1i vui nh\\u1ed9n c\\u00f9ng v\\u1edbi ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh b\\u1ed1c th\\u0103m tr\\u00fang th\\u01b0\\u1edfng h\\u1ea5p d\\u1eabn. T\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y, du kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c BUFFET H\\u1ea2I S\\u1ea2N ho\\u00e0nh tr\\u00e1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u00e0ng tr\\u0103m m\\u00f3n h\\u1ea3i s\\u1ea3n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0110\\u1ed3 S\\u01a1n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ch\\u1ebf bi\\u1ebfn b\\u1edfi c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea7u b\\u1ebfp chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p. Ch\\u1eafc ch\\u1eafn du kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd c\\u1ea3m th\\u1ea5y r\\u1ea5t tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi (chi ph\\u00ed t\\u1ef1 t\\u00fac).<\\/span><\\/span><br><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">T\\u1ed1i: Du kh\\u00e1ch ngh\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u00eam t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"NG\\u00c0Y 03: BI\\u1ec2N \\u0110\\u1ed2 S\\u01a0N - H\\u00c0 N\\u1ed8I (\\u0102N S\\u00c1NG, TR\\u01afA)\",\"content\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">05h30: <\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Du kh\\u00e1ch du l\\u1ecbch bi\\u1ec3n \\u0110\\u1ed3 S\\u01a1n n\\u00ean d\\u1eady s\\u1edbm, \\u0111i d\\u1ea1o tr\\u00ean bi\\u1ec3n ho\\u1eb7c ng\\u1ed3i nh\\u00e2m nhi ly cafe \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c kh\\u00f4ng kh\\u00ed trong l\\u1ea1nh, m\\u00e1t m\\u1ebb n\\u01a1i bi\\u1ec3n c\\u1ea3 l\\u00fac b\\u00ecnh minh<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">07h30:<\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> Du kh\\u00e1ch \\u0103n s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ea1i nh\\u00e0 h\\u00e0ng<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">08h30: <\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ef1 do th\\u0103m quan <\\/span><\\/span><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Bi\\u1ec7t th\\u1ef1 B\\u1ea3o \\u0110\\u1ea1i<\\/strong><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">11h00 :<\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> \\u0102n tr\\u01b0a, sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">12h30: <\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Du kh\\u00e1ch l\\u00e0m th\\u1ee7 t\\u1ee5c tr\\u1ea3 ph\\u00f2ng. Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00ean xe kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i.<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">13h00 :<\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> Xe \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u1ec1 H\\u1ea3i Ph\\u00f2ng. Tham quan<\\/span><\\/span><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> ch\\u00f9a D\\u01b0 H\\u00e0ng K\\u00eanh \\u2013<\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"> ng\\u00f4i ch\\u00f9a c\\u1ed5 n\\u1ed5i ti\\u1ebfng c\\u1ee7a H\\u1ea3i Ph\\u00f2ng. Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat th\\u1eddi gian tham quan &amp; mua s\\u1eafm t\\u1ea1i Ch\\u1ee3 S\\u1eaft, Ch\\u1ee3 Ga.Trong su\\u1ed1t ch\\u1eb7ng \\u0111i, h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean s\\u1ebd khu\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u1ed9ng kh\\u00f4ng kh\\u00ed vui nh\\u1ed9n b\\u1eb1ng nh\\u1eefng c\\u00e2u chuy\\u1ec7n h\\u00e0i h\\u01b0\\u1edbc, nh\\u1eefng b\\u00e0i th\\u01a1 b\\u1ea5t h\\u1ee7,...l\\u00e0m du kh\\u00e1ch th\\u1ea5y tho\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1i.<\\/span><\\/span><br><strong style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">18h00 : <\\/strong><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Xe \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i. Tr\\u1ea3 \\u0111o\\u00e0n t\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m h\\u1eb9n ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u. K\\u1ebft th\\u00fac ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh. Chia tay qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '/userfiles/images/tours/haiphong/doson.jpg', NULL, 'du-lich-ha-noi-bien-do-son-3-ngay-tour-doan', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">GIÁ TOUR BAO GỒM:</strong></span></span></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Phương tiện: Xe ôtô đời mới với hệ thống điều hòa, nội thất hiện đại đưa đón suốt hành trình</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Khách sạn đẹp, trung tâm: Tất cả các loại phòng đều có điều hoà, tivi, tắm nóng lạnh (2-3 -4 người/phòng)</li></ul><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Khách sạn tiêu chuẩn 2 sao: Hải Âu, Hoa Phượng, Hóa Chất.....<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Khách sạn tiêu chuẩn 3 sao: Công Đoàn Đồ Sơn, ....</div><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Các bữa ăn theo chương trình. Quý khách sẽ được thưởng thức các hải sản, đặc sản địa phương cực hấp dẫn trong các bữa ăn của chương trình.</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Vé thăm quan qua cửa 1 lần&nbsp;</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Bảo hiểm theo mức tránh nhiệm trong vé tắm biển của Đồ Sơn</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">GIÁ TOUR KHÔNG BAO GỒM:</strong></span></span></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Chi tiêu cá nhân: giặt là, điện thoại ...</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Đồ uống trong các bữa ăn</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Thuế VAT</li></ul><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">GHI CHÚ: Hành trình và giá tour mang tính tham khảo. Mỗi đoàn, tùy theo số lượng khách và các yêu cầu cụ thể của quý khách, chúng tôi sẽ xây dựng các chương trình tour với hành trình hợp lý với mức giá tốt nhất cho quý khách</div>', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 03:02:58', '2025-09-09 03:02:58');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `tour_code`, `name`, `duration`, `departure_point`, `remaining_slots`, `price_adult`, `price_child`, `price_toddler`, `price_infant`, `transport_mode`, `short_description`, `tour_description`, `priority`, `tour_schedule`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `slug`, `services_note`, `note`, `characteristic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(14, 'THANHOA001', 'Du lịch Sầm Sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm', '3 ngày 2 đêm', 'Hà Nội', 100, 2100000, 2100000, 2100000, 2100000, 'Ô tô', 'Thành phố Sầm Sơn cách trung tâm thành phố Thanh Hóa 16 km về phía đông, cách thủ đô Hà Nội 176 km về phía đông nam, có vị trí địa lý:\r\nPhía bắc giáp huyện Hoằng Hóa với sông Mã là ranh giới tự nhiên\r\nPhía đông giáp Vịnh Bắc Bộ\r\nPhía đông nam giáp huyện Quảng Xương\r\nPhía tây giáp thành phố Thanh Hóa.\r\nThành phố Sầm Sơn có diện tích tự nhiên 44,94 km². Sầm Sơn là thành phố có diện tích nhỏ nhất cả nước, dân số năm 2019 là 108.320 người, mật độ dân số đạt 2.430 người/km². Dân cư Sầm Sơn chủ yếu là người Kinh. Sầm Sơn nằm trên vùng đồng bằng phù sa, độ cao dưới 50 mét.\r\nKhi du khách tới Sầm Sơn sẽ được khám phá các địa điểm như: Bãi biển Sầm Sơn, Núi Trường Lệ, Hòn Trống Mái,...', NULL, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Ng\\u00e0y 01: H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i - S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n (\\u0102n: Tr\\u01b0a, t\\u1ed1i)\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\\\">Bu\\u1ed5i s\\u00e1ng<\\/strong>:<\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\\\">06h00<\\/strong>: H\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\\\">S\\u00f4ng H\\u1ed3ng Tourist<\\/strong> s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m h\\u1eb9n, kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh chuy\\u1ebfn<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\\\"> du l\\u1ecbch S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n 3 ng\\u00e0y 2 \\u0111\\u00eam<\\/strong>.<\\/li><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\\\">11h30<\\/strong>: \\u0110\\u1ebfn S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch nh\\u1eadn ph\\u00f2ng kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n, \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a v\\u00e0 ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i<\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34,