m:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Giá tour Sầm Sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm trọn gói</strong></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Hiện <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Sông Hồng Tourist</strong> đang áp dụng <b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\"><strong>giá tour Sầm Sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm</strong></b> là <b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\"><strong>2</strong></b><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">.000.000vnđ/khách</strong> (áp dụng cho đoàn trên 40 người)</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Giá tour sầm sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm:</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Xe ô tô có điều hòa đưa đón theo chương trình</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Khách sạn tiêu chuẩn, tiện nghi, sạch sẽ</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Vé tham quan, thắng cảnh.</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Hướng dẫn viên chuyên nghiệp, nhiệt tình</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Bảo hiểm du lịch 10.000.000VND/khách.</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Nước uống trên xe</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Ăn bữa chính: 150.000đ/1 người; bữa phụ: 35.000đ/1 người.</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Quà tặng: Mũ du lịch</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Giá tour sầm sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm không bao gồm:</strong></p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Thuế VAT...</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Chi phí cá nhân: Đồ uống, giặt là, điện thoại,…</li></ul>', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Giá tour có thể thay đổi vào từng thời điểm cụ thể.</span></span></p>', '<h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(35, 139, 200);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Tại sao nên chọn Sông Hồng Tourist khi du lịch</strong></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Chúng tôi đã có trên 10 năm kinh nghiệm phục vụ hàng chục ngàn khách hàng trong lĩnh vực du lịch nói chung cũng như <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Combo Sầm Sơn 3 ngày 2 đêm&nbsp;</strong>nói riêng</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style:none;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Đến với <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Sông Hồng Tourist</strong> thì bạn không cần phải lo lắng bất cứ phát sinh gì. Chúng tôi cam kết mọi khách hàng đến với chúng tôi sẽ đều đạt được sự hàng lòng nhất. Ngoài ra, <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Roboto, sans-serif !important;line-height:1.5em;transition:0.5s;\">Sông Hồng Tourist</strong> tự hào là đơn vị có:</p><ul><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Đội ngũ nhân viên phục vụ chuyên nghiệp</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Cam kết giá cả và chất lượng tốt nhất thị trường</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Đặt tour nhanh chóng chuyên nghiệp bảo mật</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;transition:0.5s;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Hàng ngàn du khách đã đi và rất hài lòng</li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.5em;list-style:initial;margin:0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text