-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Ăn 3 bữa chính mức 180k, 1 bữa sáng</span></span></li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Hướng dẫn viên nói tiếng anh, hướng dẫn viên bản địa</span></span></li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Xe đạp miễn phí ở khách sạn</span></span></li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Xe ô tô máy lạnh đưa đón theo chương trình.</span></span></li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Bảo hiểm Du lịch</span></span></li><li style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family:;\" open=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Nước uống trên xe</span></span></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 07:57:25', '2025-09-09 07:58:28'),
(16, 'THANHHOA003', 'Tour du lịch Sầm Sơn - Cửa Lò - Quê Bác 3 ngày 2 đêm', '3 ngày 2 đêm', 'Hà Nội', 100, 1950000, 1950000, 1950000, 1950000, 'Ô tô', 'Tour Du lịch Sầm Sơn - Cửa Lò - Quê Bác 3 ngày 2 đêm là hành trình kết hợp giữa nghỉ dưỡng biển và khám phá các giá trị văn hóa - lịch sử đặc sắc của miền Trung. Du khách sẽ được hòa mình vào làn nước trong xanh tại hai bãi biển nổi tiếng là Sầm Sơn (Thanh Hóa) và Cửa Lò (Nghệ An), đồng thời có dịp trở về nguồn với chuyến thăm quê hương Chủ tịch Hồ Chí Minh - nơi lưu giữ ký ức về tuổi thơ và gia đình Người. Tour hứa hẹn mang đến những trải nghiệm phong phú, phù hợp cho cả nhóm bạn, gia đình hoặc đoàn thể.', NULL, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Ng\\u00e0y 1: H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i - Bi\\u1ec3n C\\u1eeda L\\u00f2 ( \\u0102n Tr\\u01b0a, T\\u1ed1i )\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">S\\u00e1ng:<\\/strong> \\u00d4 t\\u00f4 v\\u00e0 HDV s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh \\u0111i C\\u1eeda L\\u00f2. Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0103n s\\u00e1ng (t\\u1ef1 t\\u00fac) t\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m d\\u1eebng ch\\u00e2n Ph\\u1ee7 L\\u00fd.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">11h30:<\\/strong> T\\u1edbi C\\u1eeda L\\u00f2, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch nh\\u1eadn ph\\u00f2ng kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i v\\u00e0 \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a. Chi\\u1ec1u Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ef1 do d\\u1ea1o ch\\u01a1i v\\u00e0 t\\u1eafm Bi\\u1ec3n C\\u1eeda L\\u00f2, v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng b\\u00e3i c\\u00e1t tr\\u1eafng x\\u00f3a ch\\u1ea1y d\\u00e0i b\\u00ean l\\u00e0n n\\u01b0\\u1edbc bi\\u1ec3n trong xanh.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">T\\u1ed1i:<\\/strong> \\u0102n t\\u1ed1i v\\u00e0 t\\u1ef1 do d\\u1ea1o ch\\u01a1i ng\\u1eafm c\\u1ea3nh bi\\u1ec3n v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u00eam. Ho\\u1eb7c tham gia ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh Gala (n\\u1ebfu c\\u00f3)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Ng\\u00e0y 2: Du l\\u1ecbch C\\u1eeda L\\u00f2 - Qu\\u00ea B\\u00e1c - S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n ( \\u0102n S\\u00e1ng, Tr\\u01b0a, T\\u1ed1i )\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">S\\u00e1ng: <\\/strong>\\u0110i\\u1ec3m t\\u00e2m, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch l\\u00ean xe \\u0111i tham quan Qu\\u00ea N\\u1ed9i v\\u00e0 Qu\\u00ea Ngo\\u1ea1i B\\u00e1c H\\u1ed3, Nh\\u00e0 L\\u01b0u Ni\\u1ec7m B\\u00e1c, nghe nh\\u1eefng c\\u00e2u chuy\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea3m \\u0111\\u1ed9ng v\\u1ec1 cu\\u1ed9c \\u0111\\u1eddi v\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 nghi\\u1ec7p c\\u1ee7a ch\\u1ee7 t\\u1ecbch H\\u1ed3 Ch\\u00ed Minh qua l\\u1eddi k\\u1ec3 c\\u1ee7a h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">Chi\\u1ec1u:<\\/strong> Xe \\u0111\\u01b0a qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch v\\u1ec1 S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n. Nh\\u1eadn ph\\u00f2ng ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i t\\u1ea1i S\\u1ea7m s\\u01a1n ho\\u1eb7c tham gia c\\u00e1c ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng vui ch\\u01a1i tr\\u00ean b\\u00e3i bi\\u1ec3n\\u2026<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">T\\u1ed1i:<\\/strong> Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0103n t\\u1ed1i, t\\u1ef1 do d\\u1ea1o ch\\u01a1i th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ed1 bi\\u1ec3n v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u00eam. Ngh\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u00eam t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n ho\\u1eb7c tham gia ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh Gala ( n\\u1ebfu c\\u00f3 ).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Ng\\u00e0y 3: Du l\\u1ecbch S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n - H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i ( \\u0102n S\\u00e1ng, Tr\\u01b0a )\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">S\\u00e1ng: <\\/strong>Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ef1 do mua h\\u1ea3i s\\u1ea3n, \\u0111\\u1ed3 l\\u01b0u ni\\u1ec7m. th\\u0103m quan h\\u00f2n Tr\\u1ed1ng M\\u00e1i. \\u0110o\\u00e0n d\\u00f9ng c\\u01a1m tr\\u01b0a t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">Chi\\u1ec1u:<\\/strong> Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch l\\u00e0m th\\u1ee7 t\\u1ee5c tr\\u1ea3 ph\\u00f2ng l\\u00ean \\u00f4t\\u00f4 tr\\u1edf v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i. Tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng d\\u1eebng ngh\\u1ec9 ch\\u00e2n t\\u1ea1i ch\\u1ee3 hoa qu\\u1ea3 \\u0110\\u1ed3ng Giao mua \\u0111\\u1eb7c s\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u1ecba ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u1ec1 l\\u00e0m qu\\u00e0 cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi th\\u00e2n v\\u00e0 gia \\u0111\\u00ecnh.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\"><strong style=\\\"background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\" sans-serif=\\\"\\\">17h20: <\\/strong>V\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i, k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh tour du l\\u1ecbch S\\u1ea7m S\\u01a1n C\\u1eeda l\\u00f2 Qu\\u00ea B\\u00e1c 3 ng\\u00e0y 2 \\u0111\\u00eam \\u0111\\u1ea7y th\\u00fa v\\u1ecb.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\\\" segoe=\\\"\\\">Chia tay v\\u00e0 h\\u1eb9n g\\u1eb7p l\\u1ea1i Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch trong c\\u00e1c ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh du l\\u1ecbch l\\u1ea7n sau!<\\/p>\"}]', '/userfiles/images/tours/thanhhoa/image_kxz1627229275.jpg', NULL, 'tour-du-lich-sam-son-cua-lo-que-bac-3-ngay-2-dem', '<div class=\"st-include\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><h3 class=\"title_section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;margin:30px 0px 15px;\" id=\"box_tour_include\"><strong>Dịch vụ bao gồm</strong></h3><div class=\"st-description\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:10px;position:relative;\"><ul><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Nghỉ khách sạn 2* trung tâm, phòng điều hoà, máy lạnh 2-3 người / 01phòng.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Ăn chính : 120.000 VNĐ/ Suất, ăn sáng : 30.000 VNĐ/ Suất.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Xe ô tô du lịch đời mới, máy lạnh, chất lượng cao phục vụ suốt tuyến.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Bảo hiểm du lịch ( Mức đền bù tối đa 10.000.000 VNĐ / khách).</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Hướng dẫn viên chuyên nghiệp, nhiệt tình theo đoàn trong suốt hành trình.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Thuyết minh và lệ phí quê Bác.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Nước uống : 500ml/ ngày / khách.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Quà tặng của Du Lịch Sông Hồng Tourist.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"st-hr\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-top:1px solid rgb(215, 220, 227);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"st-include\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><h3 class=\"title_section\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;margin:30px 0px 15px;\" id=\"box_tour_exclude\"><strong>Dịch vụ không bao gồm</strong></h3><div class=\"st-description\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:10px;position:relative;\"><ul><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Thuế VAT.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Đồ uống.</li><li style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Các chi phí cá nhân khác phát sinh ngoài chương trình.&nbsp;</li></ul></div></div>', '<h3 class=\"title_section\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" id=\"box_tour_policy_cancel\"><strong>Chính sách hủy</strong></h3><div class=\"st-description\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">1. Ngày Lễ, Tết: Không hoàn, không hủy, không đổi lịch.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">2. Các ngày khác:</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">- Hủy trước 15 ngày trước ngày khởi hành: Miễn phí hủy.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">- Hủy trước 08 - 14 ngày trước ngày khởi hành: Phí huỷ là 50% tổng số tiền của đơn.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">- Hủy trước 01 - 07 ngày trước ngày khởi hành: Phí huỷ là 100% tổng số tiền đã thanh toán.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">- Khách không đến: Phí hủy là 100% số tiền đã thanh toán.</p></div>', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><strong style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Tắm biển Sầm Sơn:</strong>&nbsp;một trong những bãi biển nổi tiếng bậc&nbsp;nhất miền Bắc với bãi cát dài, sóng lớn và nhiều hoạt động giải trí ven biển.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><strong style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Thư giãn tại biển Cửa Lò:</strong>&nbsp;nơi nổi tiếng với vẻ đẹp hiền hòa, hải sản tươi ngon và dịch vụ du lịch thân thiện.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\"><strong style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51) !important;font-family:BlinkMacSystemFont, -apple-system,;\" segoe=\"\" sans-serif=\"\">Thăm quê hương Chủ tịch Hồ Chí Minh:</strong>&nbsp;khu di tích Kim Liên, tìm hiểu về tuổi thơ và cuộc sống gia đình của Bác, mang lại cảm xúc sâu lắng và tự hào dân tộc.</p>', '2025-09-09 08:05:31', '2025-09-09 08:13:03');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `tour_code`, `name`, `duration`, `departure_point`, `remaining_slots`, `price_adult`, `price_child`, `price_toddler`, `price_infant`, `transport_mode`, `short_description`, `tour_description`, `priority`, `tour_schedule`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `slug`, `services_note`, `note`, `characteristic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(17, 'HATINH001', 'Tour Hà Nội – Thiên Cầm 3 ngày 2 đêm', '3 ngày 2 đêm', 'Hà Nội', 100, 2400000, 2400000, 2400000, 2400000, 'Ô tô', 'Biển Thiên Cầm Hà Tĩnh như một bức tranh thiên nhiên tuyệt mỹ. Nơi đây hội tụ đủ núi non hùng vĩ, biển xanh, cát trắng, nắng vàng. Nhờ vẻ đẹp trữ tình, Thiên Cầm được mệnh danh là “cung đàn biển” của miền Trung, thu hút du khách đến tham quan, nghỉ dưỡng.', NULL, 3, '[{\"title\":\"NG\\u00c0Y 01: H\\u00c0 N\\u1ed8I \\u2013 THI\\u00caN C\\u1ea6M (\\u0102N TR\\u01afA, T\\u1ed0I)\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">S\\u00e1ng:<\\/strong> \\u00d4 t\\u00f4 v\\u00e0 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn c\\u1ee7a C\\u00f4ng ty VIETTRANS H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m h\\u1eb9n b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u chuy\\u1ebfn<a style=\\\"background-color:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(202, 60, 8);list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettrans.vn\\/?post_type=tour&amp;s=&amp;dia-diem-tour=thien-cam&amp;khoang-gia=\\\"> <\\/a><strong>Du l\\u1ecbch Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m<\\/strong> (3 ng\\u00e0y 2 \\u0111\\u00eam).<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Tr\\u01b0a:<\\/strong> T\\u1edbi Vinh, ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a t\\u1ea1i Vinh, sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111i Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m, tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch tham quan di t\\u00edch Ng\\u00e3 ba \\u0110\\u1ed3ng L\\u1ed9c \\u2013 n\\u01a1i 10 c\\u00f4 g\\u00e1i thanh ni\\u00ean xung phong hy sinh d\\u0169ng c\\u1ea3m.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Chi\\u1ec1u:<\\/strong> \\u0110\\u1ebfn Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m, \\u0111o\\u00e0n t\\u1ef1 do t\\u1eafm bi\\u1ec3n, ng\\u1eafm ho\\u00e0ng h\\u00f4n.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">\\u0102n t\\u1ed1i, ngh\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u00eam t\\u1ea1i Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"NG\\u00c0Y 02: THI\\u00caN C\\u1ea6M (\\u0102N S\\u00c1NG, TR\\u01afA, T\\u1ed0I)\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">S\\u00e1ng: <\\/strong>Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch d\\u1eady s\\u1edbm ng\\u1eafm b\\u00ecnh minh tr\\u00ean bi\\u1ec3n v\\u00e0 t\\u1eafm bi\\u1ec3n s\\u00e1ng s\\u1edbm. Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 quay v\\u1ec1 l\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n \\u0103n s\\u00e1ng. T\\u1ef1 do kh\\u00e1m ph\\u00e1 Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Bu\\u1ed5i chi\\u1ec1u:<\\/strong> \\u0110o\\u00e0n t\\u1ef1 do t\\u1eafm bi\\u1ec3n<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">T\\u1ed1i:<\\/strong> Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch ngh\\u1ec9 ng\\u01a1i th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n t\\u1ea1i ph\\u00f2ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi tham gia b\\u1eefa t\\u1ed1i c\\u00f9ng c\\u00e1c m\\u00f3n \\u0103n bi\\u1ec3n th\\u00fa v\\u1ecb. Ngh\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u00eam t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"NG\\u00c0Y 03: THI\\u00caN C\\u1ea6M \\u2013 H\\u00c0 N\\u1ed8I (\\u0102N S\\u00c1NG, TR\\u01afA)\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">S\\u00e1ng:<\\/strong> T\\u1ea1m bi\\u1ec7t Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m, l\\u00ean xe kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh v\\u1ec1 H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i, tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch gh\\u00e9 vi\\u1ebfng m\\u1ed9 \\u0111\\u1ea1i thi h\\u00e0o Nguy\\u1ec5n Du t\\u1ea1i Ti\\u00ean \\u0110i\\u1ec1n \\u2013 Nghi Xu\\u00e2n.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">Tr\\u01b0a:<\\/strong> &nbsp;Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch \\u0103n tr\\u01b0a t\\u1ea1i Vinh.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.8;list-style:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;list-style:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;\\\">T\\u1ed1i:<\\/strong> Xe v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn H\\u00e0 N\\u1ed9i, k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac tour du l\\u1ecbch Thi\\u00ean C\\u1ea7m 3 ng\\u00e0y 2 \\u0111\\u00eam. Chia tay v\\u00e0 h\\u1eb9n g\\u1eb7p l\\u1ea1i qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch.<\\/p>\"}]', '/userfiles/images/tours/hatinh/bien-thien-cam-ha-tinh-1.jpg', NULL, 'tour-ha-noi-thien-cam-3-ngay-2-dem', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:no