;z-index:0;\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div><div class=\\\"css-901oao r-uh8wd5 r-majxgm r-fdjqy7\\\" style=\\\"border:0px solid black;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3, 18, 26);display:inline;font:500 16px \\/ 24px Godwit, NotoSansJP, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;margin:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\u0110\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean, du kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd gh\\u00e9 th\\u0103m ch\\u00f9a Thi\\u00ean M\\u1ee5 - ng\\u00f4i ch\\u00f9a c\\u1ed5 nh\\u1ea5t \\u1edf th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ed1 Hu\\u1ebf. 30 ph\\u00fat \\u0111i thuy\\u1ec1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn ch\\u00f9a v\\u00e0o bu\\u1ed5i s\\u00e1ng s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 kh\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ea7u tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi cho h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f4 n\\u00e0y. Kh\\u00f4ng kh\\u00ed trong l\\u00e0nh t\\u1eeb s\\u00f4ng H\\u01b0\\u01a1ng s\\u1ebd \\u0111em l\\u1ea1i c\\u1ea3m gi\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3ng kho\\u00e1i cho tinh th\\u1ea7n.<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"css-1dbjc4n r-eqz5dr\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-box-align:stretch;-webkit-box-direction:normal;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;align-items:stretch;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border:0px solid black;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:flex;flex-basis:auto;flex-direction:column;flex-shrink:0;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:none;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;min-height:0px;min-width:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;row-gap:8px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;z-index:0;\\\"><div class=\\\"css-1dbjc4n r-1habvwh r-18u37iz r-1h0z5md\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-b