dding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\"><strong style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background-color:transparent;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\">(chi ph\\u00ed t\\u1ef1 t\\u00fac)<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><\\/span>. Ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c vui ch\\u01a1i t\\u1ea1i <span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,128);font-size:16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\"><strong style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background-color:transparent;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\">B\\u00e0 N\\u00e0 Hills<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span>.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparent;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:;\\\" bai=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;\\\"><em style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background-color:transparent;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\">*Gi\\u00e1 combo v\\u00e9 c\\u00e1p treo B\\u00e0 N\\u00e0 Hills + v\\u00e9 buffet tr\\u01b0a tham kh\\u1ea3o: <strong style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background-color:transparent;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\\\">1,250,000VN\\u0110<\\/strong>\\/ ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/em><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparen