ace:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">9. Bảo hiểm du lịch theo quy đinh </span><b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong>Việt Nam: 10,000,000 đ/khách/ trường hợp.</strong></span></b></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(238, 238, 238);border:1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:5px 10px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong>GIÁ TOUR KHÔNG BAO GỒM:</strong></span></b></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">1. Bia rượu, nước giải khát, chi phí ngoài chương trình.</span></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">2. Tiền TIP cho hướng dẫn viên, nhân viên và lái xe.</span></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">3. Phụ thu trong trường hợp trả phòng muộn, tiền điện thoại, giặt ủi, mini bar …</span></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">4. Thuế.</span></span></div>', '<div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">1. Khi đi quý khách mang theo giấy tờ tùy thân (chứng minh nhân dân, hộ chiếu bản chính).</span></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">2. Trẻ em dưới 14 tuổi phải mang theo giấy khai sinh bản chính và đi cùng với bố mẹ, nếu đi với ông bà phải có giấy ủy quyền, trên 14 tuổi phải có giấy chứng minh nhân dân.</span></span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0cm;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">3. Quý khách có mặt tại điểm hẹn trước 30 phút, mọi sự chậm trễ </span></span><span style=\"background-color:white;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">Du lịch Thủ Đức</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><strong> </strong></span></b><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">sẽ không chịu trách nhiệm.</span></span></div>', NULL, '2025-09-10 03:35:34', '2025-09-10 03:35:34');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `tour_code`, `name`, `duration`, `departure_point`, `remaining_slots`, `price_adult`, `price_child`, `price_toddler`, `price_infant`, `transport_mode`, `short_description`, `tour_description`, `priority`, `tour_schedule`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `slug`, `services_note`, `note`, `characteristic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(22, 'TPHCM002', 'TOUR KHÁM PHÁ  ĐỊA ĐẠO CỦ CHI – MỸ THO- BẾN TRE', '1 ngày', 'TPHCM', 100, 990000, 990000, 990000, 990000, 'Ô tô', 'Một ngày trọn vẹn đưa du khách từ dấu ấn lịch sử đến vẻ đẹp sông nước miền Tây. Hành trình bắt đầu với Địa Đạo Củ Chi, nơi tái hiện tinh thần bất khuất của quân và dân ta trong thời chiến qua hệ thống đường hầm độc đáo dưới lòng đất. Rời Củ Chi, du khách đến với Mỹ Tho – Bến Tre, vùng đất hiền hòa của sông Tiền và những hàng dừa xanh mát. Tại đây, du khách sẽ được lên thuyền dạo sông, thăm các làng nghề truyền thống, thưởng thức trái cây miệt vườn, nghe đờn ca tài tử và trải nghiệm không gian miệt vườn đặc trưng Nam Bộ.', NULL, 13, '[{\"title\":\"S\\u00e1ng\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">07:00AM<\\/strong> Xe v\\u00e0 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u00f3n qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch h\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh t\\u1eeb v\\u0103n ph\\u00f2ng Nam \\u00c1 Ch\\u00e2u.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">Kho\\u1ea3ng 08:30AM<\\/strong> \\u0111\\u1ebfn C\\u1ee7 Chi, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch:<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\">Xem phim t\\u01b0 li\\u1ec7u v\\u00e0 nghe thuy\\u1ebft tr\\u00ecnh v\\u1ec1 m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh thu nh\\u1ecf c\\u1ee7a \\u0111\\u1ecba \\u0111\\u1ea1o C\\u1ee7 Chi, tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi ch\\u00ednh th\\u1ee9c tham quan v\\u00e0 tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u1ed9t \\u0111o\\u1ea1n c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ea7m \\u0111\\u1ecba \\u0111\\u1ea1o.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\">Th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed khoai m\\u00ec \\u0103n v\\u1edbi mu\\u1ed1i m\\u00e8 \\u0111\\u1ec3 hi\\u1ec3u th\\u00eam cu\\u1ed9c kh\\u00e1ng chi\\u1ebfn c\\u1ee7a qu\\u00e2n d\\u00e2n C\\u1ee7 Chi. Ngo\\u00e0i ra v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch th\\u00edch b\\u1eafn s\\u00fang th\\u00ec c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1eed s\\u1ee9c v\\u1edbi s\\u00fang AK47 ho\\u1eb7c M16 t\\u1ea1i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng b\\u1eafn t\\u1eadp ngay trong khu\\u00f4n vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ecba \\u0111\\u1ea1o.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><img class=\\\"sFlh5c FyHeAf iPVvYb aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"border-style:none;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;display:block;height:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:100%;object-fit:cover;vertical-align:middle;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cungdulich.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/cu-chi-tunnels-tour.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Tour C\\u1ee7 Chi n\\u1eeda ng\\u00e0y - Th\\u0103m \\u0111\\u1ecba \\u0111\\u1ea1o C\\u1ee7 Chi 1\\/2 ng\\u00e0y\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"590\\\" height=\\\"423\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\"><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">10:00AM<\\/strong> R\\u1eddi \\u0111\\u1ecba \\u0111\\u1ea1o C\\u1ee7 Chi l\\u00fac v\\u00e0 kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh \\u0111i M\\u1ef9 Tho B\\u1ebfn Tre.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><ul><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ebfn b\\u1ebfn du thuy\\u1ec1n TP M\\u1ef9 Tho , \\u0111o\\u00e0n xu\\u1ed1ng thuy\\u1ec1n qua <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">c\\u00f9 lao Th\\u1edbi S\\u01a1n<\\/strong>&nbsp;(hay c\\u00f2n g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 c\\u1ed3n L\\u00e2n) du kh\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea3n b\\u1ed9 tr\\u00ean \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng l\\u00e0ng, tham quan t\\u00ecm hi\\u1ec3u cu\\u1ed9c s\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00e2n \\u0111\\u1ecba ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng, v\\u01b0\\u1eddn c\\u00e2y \\u0103n tr\\u00e1i, th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c c\\u00e1c lo\\u1ea1i tr\\u00e1i c\\u00e2y theo m\\u00f9a v\\u00e0 nghe<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">&nbsp;\\u201c\\u0110\\u1eddn ca t\\u00e0i t\\u1eed\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/strong>\\u2013 m\\u1ed9t n\\u00e9t \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00e2n Nam B\\u1ed9.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\">Ti\\u1ebfp \\u0111\\u1ebfn qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c gh\\u00e9 th\\u0103m&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">trang tr\\u1ea1i nu\\u00f4i ong m\\u1eadt<\\/strong>,&nbsp;th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c tr\\u00e0 m\\u1eadt ong chanh.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li><li style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\">Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m h\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u1ecb c\\u1ee7a mi\\u1ec1n t\\u00e2y khi ng\\u1ed3i tr\\u00ean&nbsp;<strong style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\">xu\\u1ed3ng ba l\\u00e1<\\/strong>&nbsp;len l\\u1ecfi v\\u00e0o r\\u1ea1ch nh\\u1ecf ng\\u1eafm nh\\u00ecn 2 h\\u00e0ng d\\u1eeba n\\u01b0\\u1edbc thi\\u00ean nhi\\u00ean v\\u00e0 phong c\\u1ea3nh \\u0111\\u01a1n s\\u01a1 c\\u1ee7a mi\\u1ec7t v\\u01b0\\u1eddn.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;, times, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><img class=\\\"sFlh5c FyHeAf iPVvYb aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"border-style:none;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;display:block;height:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:100%;object-fit:cover;vertical-align:middle;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bonbontravel.com.vn\\/userfiles\\/images\\/du-lich-mien-tay-gia-re_du-lich-viet.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"S\\u1ea3n Ph\\u1ea9m - Du l\\u1ecbch Mi\\u1ec1n T\\u00e2y\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"597\\\" height=\\\"345\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-