 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c mong ch\\u1edd nh\\u1ea5t trong <\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\"><strong>tour V\\u0169ng T\\u00e0u 3 ng\\u00e0y 2 \\u0111\\u00eam<\\/strong><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:400;\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1.3em;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\\\"><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;\\\"><strong>08h00:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\"><strong> <\\/strong><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:400;\\\">Qu\\u00fd kh\\u00e1ch l\\u00ean c\\u00e1p treo di chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi <\\/span><b style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\\\"><strong>KDL H\\u1ed3 M\\u00e2y<\\/strong><\\/b><span style=\\\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:400;\\\">. V\\u1eeba \\u0111i v\\u1eeba \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ng\\u1eafm c\\u1ea3nh bi\\u1ec3n tr\\u1eddi bao la v\\u00e0 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ed1 V\\u0169ng T\\u00e0u t\\u1eeb tr\\u00ean cao.<\\/span><\\/p><p><a style=\\\"background-color:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(30, 115, 190);text-decoration:none;touch-action:manipulation;\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bariavungtautourism.com.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/12\\/tour-vung-tau-3-ngay-2-dem-7.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"wp-caption aligncenter image_resized\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);bo